# Virtual environments
#
# ⚠️ GLOB, not a list of known names. `venv/` alone missed `venv-eval/` — which is not a
# stray developer directory but one this repo's own docs tell you to create
# (docs-site/docs/developer-guide/rag-evaluation.md: "python3.12 -m venv backend/venv-eval").
# It is gitignored, so nothing flagged it, and at 5.6 GB it more than TRIPLED a locally built
# lite image (2.6 GB -> 8.4 GB) by landing in /app via the `COPY . .` layer. Measured, while
# trying to measure something else. A published image built on such a host would ship it.
venv*/
.venv*/
env/
ENV/
env.bak/

